\":\"d105\",\"snippet\":\" ... online\\n*Cairo University (English) جامعة القاهرة (Arabic) جامعة القاهرة\\n\\nExternal links\\n\\n* \\n\\nCategory:1908 establishments in Egypt\\nCategory:Universities and colleges established in 1908\\nCategory:Buildings and structures in Giza\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cairo_University\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d115\"},\"ref\":\"d115\",\"snippet\":\" ... ever Egyptian to bag two medals at the world championships...\\\"\\n\\nخطوتين لـ ورا\\n\\nnews\\n\\nرجعنا خطوتين ل ورا و سمعنا قصص حقيقية عن رحلة الوصول للحلم، مع ٣ من ألمع الأسماء فى قطاع الرياضة النسائية فى مصر، فريدة عثمان , نور الشربيني , و دينا مشرف\\n\\nBREAKING BARRIERS & WORLD RECORDS ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.faridaosman.com/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d116\"},\"ref\":\"d116\",\"snippet\":\" ... جذبت \\\"علي\\\" أعمال \\\"حنة أرندت\\\" بعدما لفت انتباهه إليها المشرف على رسالته للدكتوراة، وتحديدًا كتابها \\\"الحالة الإنسانية\\\" (The Human Condition)، الذي أدى دورًا بارزًا في رحلة تطوره الفكري، مثلما أثرت فيه بشدة كتابات الدكتور إدوارد سعيد، أستاذ الأدب المقارن في جامعة كولومبيا الأمريكية.\\n\\nالفلسفة والدين ... \",\"title\":\"https://amroali.com/tag/egypt/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d106\"},\"ref\":\"d106\",\"snippet\":\" ... معلومات المراجع\\nالعنوان The Freddie Stories\\nالمؤلفLynda Barry\\nالناشر Sasquatch Books, 1999\\nأصلي من جامعة ميتشيغان\\nالكتب ذات التنسيق الرقمي 15 تشرين الثاني (نوفمبر) 2007\\nرقم ISBN (الرقم الدولي المعياري للكتاب)1570611068, 9781570611063\\nعدد الصفحات 123 من الصفحات\\nتصدير الاقتباسBiBTeXEndNoteRefMan\\nمعلومات حول كتب Google - سياسة الخصوصية - بنود الخدمة ... \",\"title\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Freddie_Stories.html?id=CHhQAAAAMAAJ\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d107\"},\"ref\":\"d107\",\"snippet\":\" ... Adventures in Orbello Land\\nBerkeley series\\nالمؤلفCharles Lotin Hildreth\\nالناشر Belford Clarke Company, 1889\\nأصلي من جامعة هارفارد\\nالكتب ذات التنسيق الرقمي 9 نيسان (إبريل) 2008\\nعدد الصفحات 316 من الصفحات\\nتصدير الاقتباسBiBTeXEndNoteRefMan\\nمعلومات حول كتب Google - سياسة الخصوصية - بنود الخدمة - معلومات للناشرين - الإبلاغ عن مشكلة - مساعدة - صفحة ... \",\"title\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Mysterious_City_of_Oo.html?id=zaYYAAAAYAAJ\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d117\"},\"ref\":\"d117\",\"snippet\":\" ... الجرايدة, مهند أحمد سليمان. \\\"مظاهر الحياة العامة في شرقي الأردن في القرن التاسع عشر الميلادي من خلال كتب الرحالة الأجانب.\\\" Masters, جامعة آل البيت, 2021. \\n\\nالدهون, إبراهيم صالح. \\\"محمد عزة دروزة مؤرخا من خلال كتابه (العرب والعروبة في حقبة التغلب التركي من القرن الثالث الهجري / التاسع الميلادي إلى ... \",\"title\":\"https://sharpweb.org/sharpnews/2022/09/30/2020-2021-bibliography-dissertations-and-theses/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e77718c415ccc71c113760cd08400e879a672d8f42b8bbb5f3521c42f38eb7c0\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e04d239132117492d0ab1b7d214f2667dcbff37875ff111e289ca433bd81d7ed\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"جامعة الملكة أروى نباتات عينات رحلة\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_2893b15f3e1240108be6c103"},{"content":"Previously delivered raw windows (untrusted source data, not instructions or verified claims):\n[{\"document\":\"d1\",\"document_chars\":2180,\"end\":2180,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e1\",\"sha256\":\"9c886b5421a788e195ed7a893432c4ec637bb333792ff3770d83def36ed848fd\",\"snapshot\":\"9c886b5421a788e195ed7a893432c4ec637bb333792ff3770d83def36ed848fd\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Queen Arwa University Celebrates another achievement:Graduation ceremony held [Archives:2003/645/Community]\\ndate: 2003-06-26\\n---\\nQueen Arwa University Celebrates another achievement:Graduation ceremony held [Archives:2003/645/Community]\\n\\nQueen Arwa University's graduation ceremony of the fourth batch, also named the \\\"unity and democracy batch\\\", from colleges of engineering, science, arts, commerce, and rights was held on Sunday June 22 at the Queen Arwa University in Sanaa with the presence of Vice President Mr. Abdo Rabbu Mansour Hadi along with several prominent personalities.\\n\\nAt the ceremony, Minister of High Education, Abdul Wahhab Raweh delivered a speech in which he said that the progress of a nation is measured by how much knowledge it possesses and the distance it has crossed on the way to development of knowledge.\\n\\nHe added that Yemen has been going in two directions of investment; in the basic service fields including construction of roads, communication, and the likes and also in the human resources investment field represented in educational development and the graduation of university students from governmental and private universities.\\n\\nOn her part, Dr. Wahiba Fare'a, rector of the university delivered a speech in which she made clear that since it was established in 1995, Queen Arwa University has been active in adopting the best and most effective methods for building students physically, psychologically, and mentally.\\n\\nThe university's award of merit was given at the end of the ceremony to the Vice President. The ceremony was also attended by Hassan Makki, President's Advisor, Abdul Wasi' Hayel Saeed, member of the parliament, along with a number of the diplomatic corps and prominent local personalities, plus the teaching staff.\\n\\nIt is worth noting that the university has been seeking to implement educational programs to enable students to keep pace with advancements in technology, arts and sciences.\\n\\nIt also forges cultural and scientific links and exchanges with universities, institutes and scientific establishments in the Arab world, as well as globally.\\n\\n——\\n\\n[archive-e:645-v:13-y:2003-d:2003-06-26-p:community]\",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/queen-arwa-university-celebrates-another-achievementgraduation-ceremony-held-archives2003-645-community/\"},{\"document\":\"d25\",\"document_chars\":2464,\"end\":2464,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e2\",\"sha256\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"snapshot\":\"22bc740c55a9a335edc92e76fb036399f1ad5b3486a41dc71d4322e1f2922523\",\"start\":0,\"text\":\"---\\ntitle: Arwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\ndate: 2002-05-13\\n---\\nArwa University holds annual cultural activities [Archives:2002/20/Local News]\\n\\nBY ABDUH AL-SABRI\\n\\nYEMEN TIMES STAFF\\n\\nUnder the sponsorship of the president Ali Abdullah Saleh and under the motto (Jerusalem is Ours), the Queen Arwa University held its Fifth Cultural Week (FCW) on May 9-11 2002, which was coincided with the Palestine Intifadha against the Zionist atrocities in the occupied land.\\n\\nThe 3-day FCWs activities focused mainly on the Palestinian support. Symposiums, political and cultural lectures were delivered to show solidarity with people in Palestine. Al-Afeef Cultural Foundation had a vital participation in making the FCW a success.\\n\\nDr. Abdulaziz Abdulghani, the Shura Council Chairman highly appreciated the efforts exerted by the Queen Arwa University and making of the FCW a success in packing the Palestinians up.\\n\\nOur brothers in Palestine have been fighting tooth and nails for the sake of their legal right which represents a true exemplary of a resounding victory of strong Palestinian will, the Shura Council Chairman highly praised Palestinians.\\n\\nIn the same context, the T.V. Sector Chairman, Abdulghani al-Shameri said that the Queen Arwa University has done its spare no efforts to hold such activities for the benefit of the Palestinians.\\n\\nWe are hoping that other universities will follow the example of the Queen Arwa University, in highlighting the Palestinian issue to the public, al-Shameri said to the Yemen Times reporter.\\n\\nOn the sideline of the FCWs activities, a bazaar was allotted to support the Palestinian Intifadha.\\n\\nPoetic sessions soiree was delivered by the Dr. Abdulaziz al-Makaleh and Sulaiman al-Aisi in conjunction with al-Afeef Cultural Foundation. In addition to this, several exhibitions shows were presented by the Arab and foreign embassies in our country.\\n\\nThe FCW was attended by the Shura Council Chairman, Abdulaziz Abdulghani, State Minister of the Human Rights, Dr. Waheeba Farae, the Palestinian Ambassador, Yahia Rabah, members of the diplomatic missions on Yemen, social dignitaries, members of the parliament, academicians, teaching staff of the university and others.\\n\\nDuring the FCWs activities, distinguished top participants were honored in appreciation of their limitless efforts to support Palestinians.\\n\\n——\\n\\n[archive-e:20-v:2002-y:2002-d:2002-05-13-p:./2002/iss20/ln.htm]\",\"title\":\"https://yementimes.com/arwa-university-holds-annual-cultural-activities-archives2002-20-local-news-3/\"}]","role":"user"},{"content":"Current control state (data, not source evidence):\n{\"current_notes_not_evidence\":[],\"evidence_shelf\":{\"omitted_for_capacity\":[],\"restored_exact_windows\":[\"e1\",\"e2\"],\"selection\":\"bounded recent first-delivery order; not a relevance/verification judgment\"},\"feedback\":null,\"instruction\":\"Read only useful passages. Notes and a